t the fatigue rig to the ten-year abuse case to be safe. Run UV till the color shift shows, abrade the armrest top. Slam-test for rattles. Cycling now, no rattle so far.","continuity":" Transitioning from Ambiguity in previous phase.","style":"converger","generation_method":"framework_based","framework_influenced":true},"behaviors":["externalize_knowledge","systematic_documentation","pattern_extraction","constructive_thinking","solution_led_exploration"],"ai_usage":{"used":true,"tools":[{"tool":"Stable Diffusion","purpose":"Style transfer","interaction_type":"Image-to-image","satisfaction":4},{"tool":"Midjourney","purpose":"Design inspiration","interaction_type":"Open exploration","satisfaction":5}],"purpose":"Finding reference examples and validating intuitive decisions","effectiveness":0.7882333468428429,"reasoning":"Employing AI to externalize implicit knowledge and validate intuitive design decisions"},"outcomes":{"design_quality":59.17696993561177,"cognitive_load":5.786333473381058,"satisfaction":5,"quality":5,"innovation":3,"efficiency":5},"actual_duration":33.7,"phase_insights":["Quality concerns identified","Quality improvement from previous phase"],"framework_approach":"Starts with potential solutions to understand the problem","cognitive_style":"solution_focused","ultra_realistic_think_aloud":"Panel fit the buck, grain approved — now durability rigs. Fatigue, UV, abrasion, door slams. \"Long-term family use\" though — is that three years or ten, one kid or four climbing in? Two readings, very different cycle counts. I'll set the fatigue rig to the ten-year abuse case to be safe. Run UV till the color shift shows, abrade the armrest top. Slam-test for rattles. Cycling now, no rattle so far.","enhanced_requirements":["Develop testing based on previous phase for Industrial Design","Consider budget constraints for Industrial Design","Iterate based on feedback for Industrial Design"],"original_requirements":["Develop testing based on previous phase","Consider b