ify it on a spec line, it's how the sample sits on the wrist. Go with the soft grade, ISO 10993 tested. Lock the overmold tool, draft and DFM cleaned up, adhesive and battery sourcing named. Specs released.","continuity":" Transitioning from Vagueness in previous phase.","style":"converger","generation_method":"framework_based","framework_influenced":true},"behaviors":["request_clarification","bracket_interpretations","systematic_analysis","solution_led_exploration"],"ai_usage":{"used":true,"tools":[{"tool":"Claude","purpose":"Design critique and feedback","interaction_type":"Analytical dialogue","satisfaction":5},{"tool":"GitHub Copilot","purpose":"Interaction logic","interaction_type":"Function suggestions","satisfaction":4}],"purpose":"Exploring multiple interpretations and generating diverse options","effectiveness":0.6914304417166545,"reasoning":"Using AI to explore multiple interpretations and generate diverse solutions for ambiguous requirements"},"outcomes":{"design_quality":51.94474952269266,"cognitive_load":9.677989654811322,"satisfaction":5,"quality":3,"innovation":4,"efficiency":3},"actual_duration":46.4,"phase_insights":["Quality concerns identified","High cognitive load - challenging phase"],"framework_approach":"Starts with potential solutions to understand the problem","cognitive_style":"solution_focused","ultra_realistic_think_aloud":"Trials passed — accuracy holds, irritation stayed low. Last phase: manufacturing prep, overmold tooling, biocompatible skin-contact material. Picking the durometer, I keep landing on the softer TPE by feel — the harder one just reads clinical against skin, too rigid at the edge. Can't fully justify it on a spec line, it's how the sample sits on the wrist. Go with the soft grade, ISO 10993 tested. Lock the overmold tool, draft and DFM cleaned up, adhesive and battery sourcing named. Specs released.","enhanced_requirements":["Develop manufacturing prep based on previous phase for Industrial Design","Consider unclear requirements for Industrial Design","Iterate based on feedback for Industrial Design"],"original_requirements":["Develop manufacturing prep based on previous phase","Consider unclear requirements","Iterate based on feedback"],"cognitive_state_rationale":"Multiple valid interpretations exist in Technical Integration due to competing stakeholder interests","design_context":{"current_challenge":"Managing multiple valid interpretations while maintaining design coherence","design_approach":"Starts with potential solutions to understand the problem using solution_focused thinking","key_constraints":["Timeline: 39h allocated","Complexity: High","Dependencies: User research"],"success_criteria":["Stakeholder approval achieved","Innovative solution delivered","Technical feasibility confirmed"]},"metadata":{"phase_index":4,"total_phases":7,"domain":"Industrial Design","project_name":"Medical Equipment Design","designer":"Designer_24","timestamp":"2024-08-17"},"deliverables":["Research documents","Design iterations","Review feedback","Final deliverables"],"outcome_summary":["Acceptable quality standards met","Innovative solutions developed","Delivered within timeline","Stakeholders highly satisfied"],"completion_status":{"status":"Completed","completion_date":"2024-06-01","sign_off":"Client approved"},"cognitive_decision_step":{"action":"Prepared manufacturing specs and tooling for the overmolded, biocompatible wearable monitor housing.","artifact":"Design iterations","rationale":{"initial":"Initial approach based on tacit in requirements","improved":"Refined approach after considering unclear requirements"}},"phase_outcome":{"completion_status":"Completed","deliverables_produced":["Research documents","Design iterations","Review feedback","Final deliverables"],"progress_percentage":57,"key_decisions":["Decision based on Tacit","Resolved through Applied to Manufacturing Prep in Industrial Design context"],"iteration_count":4,"stakeholder_approval":"Approved"}}],"project_outcomes":