Lark & Finch's animation package.","artifact":"Research documents","rationale":{"initial":"Initial approach based on vagueness in requirements","improved":"Refined approach after considering budget constraints"}},"phase_outcome":{"completion_status":"Completed","deliverables_produced":["Research documents","Design iterations","Review feedback","Final deliverables"],"progress_percentage":29,"key_decisions":["Decision based on Vagueness","Resolved through Applied to Sound Design in Motion Graphics context"],"iteration_count":2,"stakeholder_approval":"Approved after iterations"}},{"phase_number":6,"phase_name":"Motion Testing","complexity":"Medium","cognitive_state":"Vagueness","requirements":["Test playback across social formats","Check motion timing and easing","Verify logo animation on dark backgrounds"],"duration_estimate":34,"think_aloud":{"phase_context":"Phase 6: Sound Design Integration.","cognitive_state":"Vagueness","utterance":"Sting's composed, SFX synced to the beats. Testing playback now. Question's how much easing survives the platform re-encodes — where does smooth start looking stepped. Push the motion too fast and Instagram's compression chews it; too slow and it drags. Checking playback across the formats, square, vertical, wide. Watching the timing and easing hold up. And the logo on dark backgrounds — making sure the mark doesn't vanish or halo. Noting which clips need a tweak before render.","continuity":" Transitioning from Uncertainty in previous phase.","style":"refiner","generation_method":"framework_based","framework_influenced":true},"behaviors":["gradual_refinement","incremental_adjustments","feedback_driven","satisficing_approach"],"ai_usage":{"used":true,"tools":[{"tool":"Midjourney","purpose":"Material and texture studies","interaction_type":"Detail refinement","satisfaction":4},{"tool":"Stable Diffusion","purpose":"Rapid prototyping visuals","interaction_type":"Local generation","satisfaction":4}],"purpose":"Concretizing vague requireme