cript Development.","cognitive_state":"Vagueness","utterance":"Style frames approved, illustration language set. Animating now. 'Reusable episode templates' — a rigid master comp everyone drops art into, or looser motion presets I reapply? Could read as either. I'll build it as presets, the intros and outros templated but the metaphor animation bespoke per episode. Animating the workflow metaphor transitions, one object morphing into the next step. Timing the reveals to the narration cues so nothing lands early. Wiring the reusable intro and lower-third templates. First animated pass exporting.","continuity":"","style":"refiner","generation_method":"framework_based","framework_influenced":true},"behaviors":["gradual_refinement","incremental_adjustments","feedback_driven","problem_decomposition"],"ai_usage":{"used":true,"tools":[{"tool":"Figma AI","purpose":"Design consistency checking","interaction_type":"Rule-based analysis","satisfaction":5},{"tool":"Midjourney","purpose":"Design inspiration","interaction_type":"Open exploration","satisfaction":5}],"purpose":"Concretizing vague requirements and finding specific examples","effectiveness":0.925998489123365,"reasoning":"Leveraging AI to clarify fuzzy requirements and generate concrete examples from vague descriptions"},"outcomes":{"design_quality":82.68828089770508,"cognitive_load":5.443719194650472,"satisfaction":5,"quality":3,"innovation":5,"efficiency":2},"actual_duration":27.7,"phase_insights":["High-quality output achieved"],"framework_approach":"Breaks problems down, seeks good-enough solutions","cognitive_style":"analytical_pragmatic","ultra_realistic_think_aloud":"Style frames approved, illustration language set. Animating now. 'Reusable episode templates' — a rigid master comp everyone drops art into, or looser motion presets I reapply? Could read as either. I'll build it as presets, the intros and outros templated but the metaphor animation bespoke per episode. Animating the workflow metaphor transitions, one object morphing into the next step. Timing the reveals to the narration cues so nothing lands early. Wiring the reusable intro and lower-third templates. First animated pass exporting.","enhanced_requirements":["Understand innovative design solution for Motion Graphics","Address tight timeline for Motion Graphics","Define project scope and constraints for Motion Graphics"],"original_requirements":["Understand innovative design solution","Address tight timeline","Define project scope and constraints"],"cognitive_state_rationale":"The boundaries and success metrics for Script Development are fuzzy and subjective","design_context":{"current_challenge":"Transforming fuzzy requirements into concrete design decisions","design_approach":"Breaks problems down, seeks good-enough solutions using analytical_pragmatic thinking","key_constraints":["Timeline: 34h allocated","Complexity: Medium","Dependencies: Design system"],"success_criteria":["Innovative solution delivered","Stakeholder approval achieved","User testing validation"]},"metadata":{"phase_index":1,"total_phases":6,"domain":"Motion Graphics","project_name":"Explainer Video Series","designer":"Designer_32","timestamp":"2024-11-25"},"deliverables":["Research documents","Design iterations","Review feedback","Final deliverables"],"outcome_summary":["Acceptable quality standards met","Innovative solutions developed","Timeline challenges encountered","Stakeholders highly satisfied"],"completion_status":{"status":"In Review","completion_date":"2024-02-20","sign_off":"Internal review complete"},"cognitive_decision_step":{"action":"Animated the workflow metaphors and reusable episode templates for the Tandem Workflows series.","artifact":"Review feedback","rationale":{"initial":"Initial approach based on ambiguity in requirements","improved":"Refined approach after considering unclear requirements"}},"phase_outcome":{"completion_status":"Completed","deliverables_produced":["Research documents","Design iterations","Review feedback","Final deliverables"],"progress_percentage":20,"key_decisions":["Decision based on Ambiguity","Resolved through Applied to Animation Design in Motion Graphics context"],"iteration_count":2,"stakeholder_approval":"Approved after iterations"}},{"phase_number":4,"phase_name":"Sound Design","complexity":"Medium","cognitive_state":"Vagueness","requirements":["Record and edit narration voiceover","Add SFX to metaphor transitions","Mix music bed under narration"],"duration_estimate":32,"think_aloud":{"phase_context":"Phase 2: Visual Style.","cognitive_state":"Vagueness","utterance":"Metaphor animations are moving, templates wired. Sound now. How loud do the transition SFX sit — enough to punctuate each metaphor morph, or so quiet they just texture it? It's a level thing. Too hot and it feels cartoony, too soft and the morphs feel weightless. Landing them low, just a soft whoosh on each transition. Recording the narration clean and even, editing out the breaths. Adding the SFX to the metaphor beats. Mixing a quiet music bed under it all so the voice stays on top. Stems bouncing.","continuity":"","style":"refiner","generation_method":"framework_based","framework_influenced":true},"behaviors":["gradual_refinement","incremental_adjustments","feedback_driven","bounded_rationality_acceptance"],"ai_usage":{"used":true,"tools":[{"tool":"Stable Diffusion","purpose":"Design iteration","interaction_type":"ControlNet guidance","satisfaction":5},{"tool":"Figma AI","purpose":"Design consistency checking","interaction_type":"Rule-based analysis","satisfaction":5}],"purpose":"Concretizing vague requirements and finding specific examples","effectiveness":0.8658894721919413,"reasoning":"Leveraging AI to clarify fuzzy requirements and generate concrete examples from vague descriptions"},"outcomes":{"design_quality":81.697828148936,"cognitive_load":5.1433576437656505,"satisfaction":5,"quality":3,"innovation":4,"efficiency":3},"actual_duration":26.1,"phase_insights":["High-quality ou