ats"],"duration_estimate":34,"think_aloud":{"phase_context":"Phase 3: Storyboarding.","cognitive_state":"Vagueness","utterance":"Frames approved, flat direction won. Animating now. Timing the transitions for feed formats — but is the target 30fps or does the agency deliver 60 for the reels? That changes my easing math. I'll build the presets at 30, flag the 60 question in the handoff. Animate three logo reveal variants, rig the social transition presets. Reveals feel crisp. Presets built, feed timings roughed in.","continuity":"","style":"explorer","generation_method":"framework_based","framework_influenced":true},"behaviors":["create_multiple_variations","visual_experimentation","broad_exploration","solution_led_exploration","abductive_reasoning_focus"],"ai_usage":{"used":true,"tools":[{"tool":"GitHub Copilot","purpose":"Documentation generation","interaction_type":"Comment completion","satisfaction":3},{"tool":"ChatGPT","purpose":"Brainstorming design concepts","interaction_type":"Conversational prompting","satisfaction":4}],"purpose":"Concretizing vague requirements and finding specific examples","effectiveness":0.8982239675456425,"reasoning":"Leveraging AI to clarify fuzzy requirements and generate concrete examples from vague descriptions"},"outcomes":{"design_quality":58.119845447563655,"cognitive_load":5.725936056722957,"satisfaction":5,"quality":3,"innovation":5,"efficiency":3},"actual_duration":34.7,"phase_insights":["Quality concerns identified"],"framework_approach":"Starts with potential solutions to understand the problem","cognitive_style":"solution_focused","ultra_realistic_think_aloud":"Frames approved, flat direction won. Animating now. Timing the transitions for feed formats — but is the target 30fps or does the agency deliver 60 for the reels? That changes my easing math. I'll build the presets at 30, flag the 60 question in the handoff. Animate three logo reveal variants, rig the social transition presets. Reveals feel crisp. Presets built, feed 