"],"iteration_count":2,"stakeholder_approval":"Approved with minor revisions"}},{"phase_number":5,"phase_name":"Motion Testing","complexity":"High","cognitive_state":"Ambiguity","requirements":["Test transitions across social platforms","Check logo timing and easing","Verify presets on sample posts"],"duration_estimate":37,"think_aloud":{"phase_context":"Phase 5: Production.","cognitive_state":"Uncertainty","utterance":"Presets are built. Now testing across platforms. This transition on the story crop — does it read as intentional or just cut off? Two ways to see it. On the square feed it's clean; vertical it clips the tail. So I pull the ease-out in eight frames, re-check on sample posts. Logo timing holds. Retested, presets sit right on all three formats now.","continuity":" Transitioning from Vagueness in previous phase.","style":"explorer","generation_method":"framework_based","framework_influenced":true},"behaviors":["prepare_multiple_scenarios","hypothesis_testing","parallel_prototyping","solution_led_exploration"],"ai_usage":{"used":true,"tools":[{"tool":"Stable Diffusion","purpose":"Style transfer","interaction_type":"Image-to-image","satisfaction":4},{"tool":"Claude","purpose":"Requirement analysis","interaction_type":"Structured analysis","satisfaction":4}],"purpose":"Researching data, analyzing trends, and gathering information","effectiveness":0.8273769423868683,"reasoning":"Utilizing AI to gather missing information and explore potential scenarios under uncertainty"},"outcomes":{"design_quality":53.9372280377261,"cognitive_load":10.541348264667043,"satisfaction":5,"quality":4,"innovation":3,"efficiency":3},"actual_duration":40.9,"phase_insights":["Quality concerns identified","High cognitive load - challenging phase"],"framework_approach":"Starts with potential solutions to understand the problem","cognitive_style":"solution_focused","ultra_realistic_think_aloud":"Presets are built. Now testing across platforms. This transition on the story crop — does 