 expectations.","market_impact":"Setting new standards in motion graphics","next_steps":"Implementation and market launch planned"}},{"project_id":"project_41_9699","persona_id":41,"persona_name":"Designer_41","project_name":"Clearpath Service Concept Explainer Series","domain":"Motion Graphics","phases":[{"phase_number":1,"phase_name":"Script Development","complexity":"High","cognitive_state":"Tacit","requirements":["Distill service concepts to plain language","Draft voiceover narration per episode","Time script to target duration"],"duration_estimate":44,"think_aloud":{"phase_context":"Phase 4: Animation.","cognitive_state":"Tacit","utterance":"Fresh brief — explainer series, simplify Clearpath Digital's services for a general audience. So the script. Distill the service concepts to plain language. I read their capabilities deck and just — this line, 'orchestrated workflows,' cut it, feels corporate. This one, 'we handle the boring parts,' keep, that lands. Can't fully justify why one sings, it just does. Draft the voiceover per episode, read it aloud, time to ninety seconds. Three episodes drafted, conversational. That's the voice.","continuity":"","style":"refiner","generation_method":"framework_based","framework_influenced":true},"behaviors":["leverage_experience","iterative_refinement","implicit_adjustment","conversation_with_materials","reflection_in_action"],"ai_usage":{"used":true,"tools":[{"tool":"GitHub Copilot","purpose":"Documentation generation","interaction_type":"Comment completion","satisfaction":3},{"tool":"Claude","purpose":"Design critique and feedback","interaction_type":"Analytical dialogue","satisfaction":5}],"purpose":"Finding reference examples and validating intuitive decisions","effectiveness":0.8976300141524762,"reasoning":"Employing AI to externalize implicit knowledge and validate intuitive design decisions"},"outcomes":{"design_quality":57.36881429210802,"cognitive_load":5.958021352649292,"satisfaction":5,"quality":5,"innovation":3,"ef