't know: is the final VO the hired talent or my scratch track? Booking's not confirmed. I'll edit against my scratch, keep the timing loose so a real read can slot in later — flag that for the producer. Ambient bed, low, warm pads. Sync the little pops to the icon hits. Episode one sounds alive.","continuity":" Transitioning from Vagueness in previous phase.","style":"refiner","generation_method":"framework_based","framework_influenced":true},"behaviors":["leverage_experience","iterative_refinement","implicit_adjustment","iterative_reflection_cycles"],"ai_usage":{"used":true,"tools":[{"tool":"Figma AI","purpose":"UI component generation","interaction_type":"Design system automation","satisfaction":4},{"tool":"GitHub Copilot","purpose":"Interaction logic","interaction_type":"Function suggestions","satisfaction":4}],"purpose":"Finding reference examples and validating intuitive decisions","effectiveness":0.6285782055919004,"reasoning":"Employing AI to externalize implicit knowledge and validate intuitive design decisions"},"outcomes":{"design_quality":61.02836458364444,"cognitive_load":4.508768844791023,"satisfaction":5,"quality":4,"innovation":5,"efficiency":4},"actual_duration":26.8,"phase_insights":["Quality improvement from previous phase"],"framework_approach":"Continuous dialogue between action and reflection","cognitive_style":"reflective","ultra_realistic_think_aloud":"Scenes animate clean, icons morph nicely — now sound. Record and edit the voiceover, lay a music bed. One thing I don't know: is the final VO the hired talent or my scratch track? Booking's not confirmed. I'll edit against my scratch, keep the timing loose so a real read can slot in later — flag that for the producer. Ambient bed, low, warm pads. Sync the little pops to the icon hits. Episode one sounds alive.","enhanced_requirements":["Develop sound design based on previous phase for Motion Graphics","Consider tight timeline for Motion Graphics","Iterate based on feedback for Motion Graphics"],