velopment.","cognitive_state":"Vagueness","utterance":"Style frames done, palette's set, rigged icons ready. Animating now. \"Lightweight\" — is that few keyframes, or literally low file weight for web? Could go either way. I'll take it as simple motion, easy to render. Reusing the rigged panel: one slide-in, one scale-pop, apply across scenes. Core explainer beats first — the offering reveal gets the cleanest move. Keep it under a couple seconds a shot. Clear over clever. That's the animation pass, and it reuses everything I built.","continuity":"","style":"explorer","generation_method":"framework_based","framework_influenced":true},"behaviors":["create_multiple_variations","visual_experimentation","broad_exploration","solution_led_exploration","constructive_thinking"],"ai_usage":{"used":true,"tools":[{"tool":"Figma AI","purpose":"Layout suggestions","interaction_type":"Auto-layout","satisfaction":3},{"tool":"ChatGPT","purpose":"Generating design rationale","interaction_type":"Explanatory prompts","satisfaction":4}],"purpose":"Concretizing vague requirements and finding specific examples","effectiveness":0.9364533001610333,"reasoning":"Leveraging AI to clarify fuzzy requirements and generate concrete examples from vague descriptions"},"outcomes":{"design_quality":30.51245268182296,"cognitive_load":5.690227846794979,"satisfaction":5,"quality":3,"innovation":5,"efficiency":3},"actual_duration":29.2,"phase_insights":["Quality concerns identified"],"framework_approach":"Starts with potential solutions to understand the problem","cognitive_style":"solution_focused","ultra_realistic_think_aloud":"Style frames done, palette's set, rigged icons ready. Animating now. \"Lightweight\" — is that few keyframes, or literally low file weight for web? Could go either way. I'll take it as simple motion, easy to render. Reusing the rigged panel: one slide-in, one scale-pop, apply across scenes. Core explainer beats first — the offering reveal gets the cleanest move. Keep it under a 