ith light effects to the Quill Analytics explainer.","artifact":"Research documents","rationale":{"initial":"Initial approach based on vagueness in requirements","improved":"Refined approach after considering tight timeline"}},"phase_outcome":{"completion_status":"Completed","deliverables_produced":["Research documents","Design iterations","Review feedback","Final deliverables"],"progress_percentage":29,"key_decisions":["Decision based on Vagueness","Resolved through Applied to Sound Design in Motion Graphics context"],"iteration_count":5,"stakeholder_approval":"Approved after iterations"}},{"phase_number":6,"phase_name":"Rendering","complexity":"High","cognitive_state":"Vagueness","requirements":["Batch-render animation scenes at final resolution","Optimize render settings for cost efficiency","Check color and motion consistency across clips"],"duration_estimate":42,"think_aloud":{"phase_context":"Phase 6: Final Compositing.","cognitive_state":"Vagueness","utterance":"Sound's mixed, VO sits clean under the track. Rendering. \"Cost efficient settings\" — how far do I push compression before it shows? Fuzzy edge there. I'll render at 1080p final, medium bitrate, eyeball one scene first. Batch the whole series overnight so I'm not paying the farm per-clip idle. Check color holds across scenes — that accent shouldn't drift. Motion consistency on the reused panels. Looks solid. Full batch queued at final res.","continuity":" Transitioning from Tacit in previous phase.","style":"explorer","generation_method":"framework_based","framework_influenced":true},"behaviors":["create_multiple_variations","visual_experimentation","broad_exploration","abductive_reasoning_focus","constructive_thinking"],"ai_usage":{"used":true,"tools":[{"tool":"Figma AI","purpose":"Design consistency checking","interaction_type":"Rule-based analysis","satisfaction":5},{"tool":"ChatGPT","purpose":"Brainstorming design concepts","interaction_type":"Conversational prompting","satisfaction":4}],"purpose