ge","Produce quick client-review renders"],"duration_estimate":35,"think_aloud":{"phase_context":"Phase 1: Urban Context Study.","cognitive_state":"Ambiguity","utterance":"Palette's set, quick-lead stuff. Now renders in context — and how dense do I show the surroundings? Full built-out downtown crowding it, or a cleaner frame that lets the frontage speak? One reads honest and tight, the other flatters the building. For a quick client review I split it — one contextual shot with the real neighbors close, one tighter on the ground-floor commercial frontage. Fast turnaround, low-res passes first. Good enough to approve, not fussing over reflections. Push them out.","continuity":"","style":"refiner","generation_method":"framework_based","framework_influenced":true},"behaviors":["leverage_past_cases","pragmatic_approach","iterative_testing","frame_creation"],"ai_usage":{"used":true,"tools":[{"tool":"ChatGPT","purpose":"Brainstorming design concepts","interaction_type":"Conversational prompting","satisfaction":4},{"tool":"Stable Diffusion","purpose":"Style transfer","interaction_type":"Image-to-image","satisfaction":4}],"purpose":"Exploring multiple interpretations and generating diverse options","effectiveness":0.7441246920852739,"reasoning":"Using AI to explore multiple interpretations and generate diverse solutions for ambiguous requirements"},"outcomes":{"design_quality":62.10373262799183,"cognitive_load":9.492375253239908,"satisfaction":5,"quality":3,"innovation":5,"efficiency":4},"actual_duration":33.3,"phase_insights":["High cognitive load - challenging phase"],"framework_approach":"Creates entirely new frames for understanding problems","cognitive_style":"transformative","ultra_realistic_think_aloud":"Palette's set, quick-lead stuff. Now renders in context — and how dense do I show the surroundings? Full built-out downtown crowding it, or a cleaner frame that lets the frontage speak? One reads honest and tight, the other flatters the building. For a quick client r