eing able to fully articulate why over a braced bay. It just feels right for how the retail wants to stay open, the way the loads want to come down. I've done enough of these to trust that read. Detail the key connections at the transfer, draft the docs lean, finalize specs and schedules. Ship it.","enhanced_requirements":["Develop technical drawings based on previous phase for Architecture","Consider budget constraints for Architecture","Iterate based on feedback for Architecture"],"original_requirements":["Develop technical drawings based on previous phase","Consider budget constraints","Iterate based on feedback"],"cognitive_state_rationale":"The designer's implicit understanding guides decisions that are hard to articulate","design_context":{"current_challenge":"Articulating intuitive design decisions for stakeholder buy-in","design_approach":"Creates entirely new frames for understanding problems using transformative thinking","key_constraints":["Timeline: 46h allocated","Complexity: High","Dependencies: Design system"],"success_criteria":["Stakeholder approval achieved","Design principles maintained","User testing validation"]},"metadata":{"phase_index":4,"total_phases":6,"domain":"Architecture","project_name":"Mixed-Use Urban Development","designer":"Designer_45","timestamp":"2024-06-09"},"deliverables":["Construction documents","Detail drawings","Specifications","Schedules"],"outcome_summary":["High quality output achieved","Some creative elements incorporated","Completed ahead of schedule","Stakeholders highly satisfied"],"completion_status":{"status":"Approved","completion_date":"2024-09-26","sign_off":"Internal review complete"},"cognitive_decision_step":{"action":"Produced fast-tracked construction documents and schedules for the compact downtown development.","artifact":"Specifications","rationale":{"initial":"Initial approach based on tacit in requirements","improved":"Refined approach after considering unclear requirements"}},"phase_outcome":{"complet