ess in requirements","improved":"Refined approach after considering unclear requirements"}},"phase_outcome":{"completion_status":"Completed","deliverables_produced":["Construction documents","Detail drawings","Specifications","Schedules"],"progress_percentage":40,"key_decisions":["Decision based on Vagueness","Resolved through Applied to Technical Drawings in Architecture context"],"iteration_count":5,"stakeholder_approval":"Approved after iterations"}},{"phase_number":5,"phase_name":"Documentation","complexity":"High","cognitive_state":"Tacit","requirements":["Finalize affordable-housing drawing set","Compile durable-material specifications","Deliver documentation to Ashford Property Trust"],"duration_estimate":46,"think_aloud":{"phase_context":"Phase 4: Schematic Design.","cognitive_state":"Vagueness","utterance":"CDs and schedules are drafted. Now compile the final set for Ashford Property Trust. This spec sheet — the render finish, something's off. Can't fully justify it, but that coating on a north elevation won't weather evenly, I've seen it streak. Swap it, feels right now. Finalize the affordable-housing drawing set, pull the durable-material specs together, cross-check the schedules against the plans. Package it all. Deliver to Ashford Property Trust. Done — twenty years in, you trust the eye on a finish.","continuity":" Transitioning from Ambiguity in previous phase.","style":"refiner","generation_method":"framework_based","framework_influenced":true},"behaviors":["gradual_refinement","incremental_adjustments","feedback_driven","constraint_as_creativity"],"ai_usage":{"used":true,"tools":[{"tool":"Figma AI","purpose":"Prototype interactions","interaction_type":"Smart animate","satisfaction":4},{"tool":"ChatGPT","purpose":"Exploring design alternatives","interaction_type":"Iterative refinement","satisfaction":3}],"purpose":"Concretizing vague requirements and finding specific examples","effectiveness":0.7541424261490342,"reasoning":"Leveraging AI to clarify 