tions","Develop 3D model of typical floor"],"duration_estimate":44,"think_aloud":{"phase_context":"Phase 6: Construction Documents.","cognitive_state":"Vagueness","utterance":"Okay, schematic's approved, the stacked units fit budget. Now I detail them. Question is how thin can I push these wall sections. 200mm block, single leaf load-bearing? Where's the line between cheap and just failing insulation code. It's a dial really — shave the section, save concrete, but not so lean the acoustics tank. Fine. I'll lock the unit at 3.6 by 8.4, one repeatable bay. Draw the simple load-bearing wall section, run the typical floor into 3D. Standardize everything, one detail repeated forty times.","continuity":" Transitioning from Uncertainty in previous phase.","style":"refiner","generation_method":"framework_based","framework_influenced":true},"behaviors":["gradual_refinement","incremental_adjustments","feedback_driven","constraint_as_creativity","problem_solution_coevolution"],"ai_usage":{"used":true,"tools":[{"tool":"Figma AI","purpose":"Prototype interactions","interaction_type":"Smart animate","satisfaction":4},{"tool":"Stable Diffusion","purpose":"Texture generation","interaction_type":"Pattern creation","satisfaction":3}],"purpose":"Concretizing vague requirements and finding specific examples","effectiveness":0.6410669412092251,"reasoning":"Leveraging AI to clarify fuzzy requirements and generate concrete examples from vague descriptions"},"outcomes":{"design_quality":28.050300325797167,"cognitive_load":8.642255062586717,"satisfaction":5,"quality":4,"innovation":3,"efficiency":3},"actual_duration":58.3,"phase_insights":["Quality concerns identified","High cognitive load - challenging phase"],"framework_approach":"Redefines problems, uses constraints creatively","cognitive_style":"negotiative","ultra_realistic_think_aloud":"Okay, schematic's approved, the stacked units fit budget. Now I detail them. Question is how thin can I push these wall sections. 200mm block, single 