bias toward buildable: dumb, forgiving wall-to-slab junction the labourers can't get wrong. Draft the typical floor plan, detail the slab-wall junction, compile door and finish schedules. Keep the schedule short — three door types, two finishes, repeated everywhere.","continuity":" Transitioning from Tacit in previous phase.","style":"refiner","generation_method":"framework_based","framework_influenced":true},"behaviors":["safe_choices","proven_patterns","incremental_optimization","constraint_as_creativity","problem_solution_coevolution"],"ai_usage":{"used":true,"tools":[{"tool":"Figma AI","purpose":"Layout suggestions","interaction_type":"Auto-layout","satisfaction":3},{"tool":"Stable Diffusion","purpose":"Texture generation","interaction_type":"Pattern creation","satisfaction":3}],"purpose":"Researching data, analyzing trends, and gathering information","effectiveness":0.6827295303179594,"reasoning":"Utilizing AI to gather missing information and explore potential scenarios under uncertainty"},"outcomes":{"design_quality":30.751391492523382,"cognitive_load":10.825930588394343,"satisfaction":5,"quality":2,"innovation":4,"efficiency":2},"actual_duration":71.8,"phase_insights":["Quality concerns identified","High cognitive load - challenging phase"],"framework_approach":"Redefines problems, uses constraints creatively","cognitive_style":"negotiative","ultra_realistic_think_aloud":"Renders are out for review. Now construction drawings. 'Simple junctions' — simple to draw, or simple to build on site. Not the same thing. A slick detail on paper can be a nightmare for the crew. I'll bias toward buildable: dumb, forgiving wall-to-slab junction the labourers can't get wrong. Draft the typical floor plan, detail the slab-wall junction, compile door and finish schedules. Keep the schedule short — three door types, two finishes, repeated everywhere.","enhanced_requirements":["Develop technical drawings based on previous phase for Architecture","Consider unclear requirements f