 it. Full specs and calcs bound in, or just the drawings plus a spec index. Depends how much the reviewer pushes. I'll err complete — consolidate all the permit drawings, compile the spec and review records, bundle it. Better to hand over a fat set than get bounced for a missing sheet. Finalize the deliverable package, hand off to Rowan Infill Developments.","continuity":"","style":"explorer","generation_method":"framework_based","framework_influenced":true},"behaviors":["explore_multiple_interpretations","create_divergent_options","delay_decisions","constructive_thinking","solution_led_exploration"],"ai_usage":{"used":true,"tools":[{"tool":"Figma AI","purpose":"Design consistency checking","interaction_type":"Rule-based analysis","satisfaction":5},{"tool":"GitHub Copilot","purpose":"Documentation generation","interaction_type":"Comment completion","satisfaction":3}],"purpose":"Exploring multiple interpretations and generating diverse options","effectiveness":0.6257034169453297,"reasoning":"Using AI to explore multiple interpretations and generate diverse solutions for ambiguous requirements"},"outcomes":{"design_quality":48.67766264084973,"cognitive_load":9.743012499296027,"satisfaction":5,"quality":3,"innovation":5,"efficiency":2},"actual_duration":44,"phase_insights":["Quality concerns identified","High cognitive load - challenging phase"],"framework_approach":"Starts with potential solutions to understand the problem","cognitive_style":"solution_focused","ultra_realistic_think_aloud":"Junctions drafted, docs done. Final permit package now. 'Permit-ready' — how complete does the authority actually want it. Full specs and calcs bound in, or just the drawings plus a spec index. Depends how much the reviewer pushes. I'll err complete — consolidate all the permit drawings, compile the spec and review records, bundle it. Better to hand over a fat set than get bounced for a missing sheet. Finalize the deliverable package, hand off to Rowan Infill Developments.","enhanc