voring? Changes everything. I'll interview them, pin down tone and audience directly, list the must-have showcases. Getting the goals in the research doc first.","continuity":" Transitioning from Uncertainty in previous phase.","style":"refiner","generation_method":"framework_based","framework_influenced":true},"behaviors":["gradual_refinement","incremental_adjustments","feedback_driven","satisficing_approach"],"ai_usage":{"used":true,"tools":[{"tool":"Figma AI","purpose":"Design consistency checking","interaction_type":"Rule-based analysis","satisfaction":5},{"tool":"Midjourney","purpose":"Aesthetic exploration","interaction_type":"Style prompting","satisfaction":5}],"purpose":"Concretizing vague requirements and finding specific examples","effectiveness":0.6205019654113031,"reasoning":"Leveraging AI to clarify fuzzy requirements and generate concrete examples from vague descriptions"},"outcomes":{"design_quality":80.8610396135312,"cognitive_load":5.55477433740495,"satisfaction":5,"quality":4,"innovation":3,"efficiency":3},"actual_duration":16.3,"phase_insights":["High-quality output achieved","Quality improvement from previous phase"],"framework_approach":"Breaks problems down, seeks good-enough solutions","cognitive_style":"analytical_pragmatic","ultra_realistic_think_aloud":"New one — personal portfolio for Mara Bellini, showcase creative work. Engaging gallery. But engaging how? Client said it in the kickoff and it could mean bold and animated, or quiet so the work speaks. Two very different sites. And the audience — recruiters scanning fast, or clients savoring? Changes everything. I'll interview them, pin down tone and audience directly, list the must-have showcases. Getting the goals in the research doc first.","enhanced_requirements":["Develop requirements gathering based on previous phase for Web Design","Consider unclear requirements for Web Design","Iterate based on feedback for Web Design"],"original_requirements":["Develop requirements gathering based 