","cognitive_state":"Vagueness","requirements":["Define breakpoints for phone and tablet","Test layout reflow across devices","Optimize images for mobile"],"duration_estimate":23,"think_aloud":{"phase_context":"Phase 2: User Research.","cognitive_state":"Uncertainty","utterance":"Gestures prototyped — now it has to hold across devices. 'Optimizing across mobile' is a spectrum, though. Do I stop at phones, or push tablet too? Where does mobile end. I'll set two breakpoints, 390 phone and 768 tablet, and let it fluid between. Testing reflow — cart summary stacks clean, grid drops to two-up. Optimizing images, serving smaller sources under 500px. Responsive layouts documented.","continuity":"","style":"explorer","generation_method":"framework_based","framework_influenced":true},"behaviors":["prepare_multiple_scenarios","hypothesis_testing","parallel_prototyping","abductive_leap","paradigm_shift_thinking"],"ai_usage":{"used":true,"tools":[{"tool":"Figma AI","purpose":"UI component generation","interaction_type":"Design system automation","satisfaction":4},{"tool":"GitHub Copilot","purpose":"Design system coding","interaction_type":"Component generation","satisfaction":4}],"purpose":"Researching data, analyzing trends, and gathering information","effectiveness":0.9251502383222027,"reasoning":"Utilizing AI to gather missing information and explore potential scenarios under uncertainty"},"outcomes":{"design_quality":75.05944235917619,"cognitive_load":7.478150038455967,"satisfaction":5,"quality":3,"innovation":3,"efficiency":2},"actual_duration":20.3,"phase_insights":["Quality improvement from previous phase"],"framework_approach":"Creates entirely new frames for understanding problems","cognitive_style":"transformative","ultra_realistic_think_aloud":"Gestures prototyped — now it has to hold across devices. 'Optimizing across mobile' is a spectrum, though. Do I stop at phones, or push tablet too? Where does mobile end. I'll set two breakpoints, 390 phone and 768 tablet, and let it fluid between. Testing reflow — cart summary stacks clean, grid drops to two-up. Optimizing images, serving smaller sources under 500px. Responsive layouts documented.","enhanced_requirements":["Develop responsive design based on previous phase for Web Design","Consider tight timeline for Web Design","Iterate based on feedback for Web Design"],"original_requirements":["Develop responsive design based on previous phase","Consider tight timeline","Iterate based on feedback"],"cognitive_state_rationale":"External dependencies and unknowns block decision-making in User Research","design_context":{"current_challenge":"Making progress despite missing critical information","design_approach":"Creates entirely new frames for understanding problems using transformative thinking","key_constraints":["Timeline: 23h allocated","Complexity: Medium","Dependencies: User research"],"success_criteria":["Stakeholder approval achieved","Technical feasibility confirmed","Design principles maintained"]},"metadata":{"phase_index":2,"total_phases":8,"domain":"Web Design","project_name":"E-commerce Website Redesign","designer":"Designer_60","timestamp":"2024-02-03"},"deliverables":["Research documents","Design iterations","Review feedback","Final deliverables"],"outcome_summary":["Acceptable quality standards met","Some creative elements incorporated","Timeline challenges encountered","Stakeholders highly satisfied"],"completion_status":{"status":"Approved","completion_date":"2024-04-14","sign_off":"Client approved"},"cognitive_decision_step":{"action":"Built responsive layouts and breakpoints optimizing the storefront across mobile devices.","artifact":"Final deliverables","rationale":{"initial":"Initial approach based on vagueness in requirements","improved":"Refined approach after considering tight timeline"}},"phase_outcome":{"completion_status":"Completed","deliverables_produced":["Research documents","Design iterations","Review feedback","Final deliverables"],"progress_percenta