9200521619436,"reasoning":"Utilizing AI to gather missing information and explore potential scenarios under uncertainty"},"outcomes":{"design_quality":49.18665089047405,"cognitive_load":6.858792483112581,"satisfaction":5,"quality":2,"innovation":4,"efficiency":2},"actual_duration":25.4,"phase_insights":["Quality concerns identified"],"framework_approach":"Creates entirely new frames for understanding problems","cognitive_style":"transformative","ultra_realistic_think_aloud":"New project — Cedarline Supply, reorganize the catalog, modernize buying. First, requirements. \"Catalog pain\" is a broad thing though. Is the pain that customers can't find products, or that merch can't maintain the tree? Different fixes entirely. I'll pull both from the interviews and let the analytics arbitrate. Talking to merch and support, auditing the current taxonomy, documenting search and conversion numbers. Only eight years in but I know to get the data before I theorize. Requirements doc started.","enhanced_requirements":["Develop requirements gathering based on previous phase for Web Design","Consider unclear requirements for Web Design","Iterate based on feedback for Web Design"],"original_requirements":["Develop requirements gathering based on previous phase","Consider unclear requirements","Iterate based on feedback"],"cognitive_state_rationale":"Technical or market uncertainties in Web Design prevent confident progress","design_context":{"current_challenge":"Making progress despite missing critical information","design_approach":"Creates entirely new frames for understanding problems using transformative thinking","key_constraints":["Timeline: 23h allocated","Complexity: Medium","Dependencies: User research"],"success_criteria":["Stakeholder approval achieved","Innovative solution delivered","User testing validation"]},"metadata":{"phase_index":2,"total_phases":8,"domain":"Web Design","project_name":"E-commerce Website Redesign","designer":"Designer_63","timestamp":"2024-10-02"}