ples","effectiveness":0.943704931681864,"reasoning":"Leveraging AI to clarify fuzzy requirements and generate concrete examples from vague descriptions"},"outcomes":{"design_quality":58.43838061845567,"cognitive_load":5.52366787314805,"satisfaction":5,"quality":4,"innovation":5,"efficiency":3},"actual_duration":30.6,"phase_insights":["Quality concerns identified","Quality improvement from previous phase"],"framework_approach":"Continuous dialogue between action and reflection","cognitive_style":"reflective","ultra_realistic_think_aloud":"Wireframes arranged, nav clicks through — now the visual layer. Data density. How much white space around each chart before it reads calm versus empty? Analysts want tight, packed, everything at once; managers want it to breathe. It's a dial between them. I'll set a mid density with a comfortable toggle later. Designing the high-fi metric mockups, building the reusable chart component library, documenting color and type tokens now, spacing scale locked at 8px.","enhanced_requirements":["Develop visual design based on previous phase for UI/UX Design","Consider unclear requirements for UI/UX Design","Iterate based on feedback for UI/UX Design"],"original_requirements":["Develop visual design based on previous phase","Consider unclear requirements","Iterate based on feedback"],"cognitive_state_rationale":"The boundaries and success metrics for Developer Handoff are fuzzy and subjective","design_context":{"current_challenge":"Transforming fuzzy requirements into concrete design decisions","design_approach":"Continuous dialogue between action and reflection using reflective thinking","key_constraints":["Timeline: 30h allocated","Complexity: Medium","Dependencies: Stakeholder approval"],"success_criteria":["High quality standards met","Technical feasibility confirmed","Stakeholder approval achieved"]},"metadata":{"phase_index":6,"total_phases":6,"domain":"UI/UX Design","project_name":"SaaS Dashboard Redesign","designer":"Designer_65","tim