ats and flag it in the handoff note. Redlines on the metric cards, spacing tokens exported. Walkthrough booked for Thursday — I'll confirm their stack live and answer component questions then.","enhanced_requirements":["Develop design handoff based on previous phase for UI/UX Design","Consider unclear requirements for UI/UX Design","Iterate based on feedback for UI/UX Design"],"original_requirements":["Develop design handoff based on previous phase","Consider unclear requirements","Iterate based on feedback"],"cognitive_state_rationale":"Uncertainty in Design Handoff due to budget constraints","design_context":{"current_challenge":"Managing multiple valid interpretations while maintaining design coherence","design_approach":"Continuous dialogue between action and reflection using reflective thinking","key_constraints":["Timeline: 43h allocated","Complexity: High","Dependencies: Technical specs"],"success_criteria":["Design principles maintained","Innovative solution delivered","High quality standards met"]},"metadata":{"phase_index":1,"total_phases":6,"domain":"UI/UX Design","project_name":"SaaS Dashboard Redesign","designer":"Designer_65","timestamp":"2024-08-10"},"deliverables":["Research documents","Design iterations","Review feedback","Final deliverables"],"outcome_summary":["High quality output achieved","Innovative solutions developed","Completed ahead of schedule","Stakeholders highly satisfied"],"completion_status":{"status":"Approved","completion_date":"2024-11-13","sign_off":"Internal review complete"},"cognitive_decision_step":{"action":"Packaged annotated specs, exported assets, and handed off the finalized dashboard design system to Cadence Analytics engineering.","artifact":"Final deliverables","rationale":{"initial":"Initial approach based on uncertainty in requirements","improved":"Refined approach after considering budget constraints"}},"phase_outcome":{"completion_status":"Completed","deliverables_produced":["Research documents","Design iterations"