:"High","cognitive_state":"Vagueness","requirements":["Sketch clear data-view layouts","Diagram decision-support user flows","Build clickable wireframe prototype"],"duration_estimate":50,"think_aloud":{"phase_context":"Phase 2: Information Architecture.","cognitive_state":"Ambiguity","utterance":"IA's decision-first — now low-fi wireframes. Sketching clear data layouts. 'Clear' is a dial here — how much do I strip before clarity turns into hiding the data managers actually need? Too clean and they lose trust in the number. Pulling back one notch: headline metric big, supporting figures present but quiet, not gone. Decision-support flows diagrammed. Clickable wireframe stitched, ready to walk through.","continuity":"","style":"explorer","generation_method":"framework_based","framework_influenced":true},"behaviors":["explore_multiple_interpretations","create_divergent_options","delay_decisions","frame_creation"],"ai_usage":{"used":true,"tools":[{"tool":"Midjourney","purpose":"Concept visualization","interaction_type":"Creative generation","satisfaction":4},{"tool":"Figma AI","purpose":"Design consistency checking","interaction_type":"Rule-based analysis","satisfaction":5}],"purpose":"Exploring multiple interpretations and generating diverse options","effectiveness":0.8340992897370273,"reasoning":"Using AI to explore multiple interpretations and generate diverse solutions for ambiguous requirements"},"outcomes":{"design_quality":52.468426982165056,"cognitive_load":10.23381751076975,"satisfaction":5,"quality":4,"innovation":4,"efficiency":4},"actual_duration":59.5,"phase_insights":["Quality concerns identified","High cognitive load - challenging phase","Quality improvement from previous phase"],"framework_approach":"Creates entirely new frames for understanding problems","cognitive_style":"transformative","ultra_realistic_think_aloud":"IA's decision-first — now low-fi wireframes. Sketching clear data layouts. 'Clear' is a dial here — how much do I strip before clarity turns into hiding the data managers actually need? Too clean and they lose trust in the number. Pulling back one notch: headline metric big, supporting figures present but quiet, not gone. Decision-support flows diagrammed. Clickable wireframe stitched, ready to walk through.","enhanced_requirements":["Develop wireframing based on previous phase for UI/UX Design","Consider tight timeline for UI/UX Design","Iterate based on feedback for UI/UX Design"],"original_requirements":["Develop wireframing based on previous phase","Consider tight timeline","Iterate based on feedback"],"cognitive_state_rationale":"The requirements for Information Architecture can be satisfied in fundamentally different ways","design_context":{"current_challenge":"Managing multiple valid interpretations while maintaining design coherence","design_approach":"Creates entirely new frames for understanding problems using transformative thinking","key_constraints":["Timeline: 50h allocated","Complexity: High","Dependencies: Technical specs"],"success_criteria":["Technical feasibility confirmed","Stakeholder approval achieved","Design principles maintained"]},"metadata":{"phase_index":2,"total_phases":6,"domain":"UI/UX Design","project_name":"SaaS Dashboard Redesign","designer":"Designer_67","timestamp":"2024-11-13"},"deliverables":["Low-fidelity wireframes","User flows","Information architecture","Clickable prototype"],"outcome_summary":["High quality output achieved","Innovative solutions developed","Completed ahead of schedule","Stakeholders highly satisfied"],"completion_status":{"status":"In Review","completion_date":"2024-11-07","sign_off":"Client approved"},"cognitive_decision_step":{"action":"Produced low-fidelity wireframes and user flows emphasizing data clarity for Tessellate decision makers.","artifact":"Low-fidelity wireframes","rationale":{"initial":"Initial approach based on vagueness in requirements","improved":"Refined approach after considering tight timeline"}},"phase_outcome":{"completion_status":"Completed","deliverables_produced":["Low-fidelity wireframes","User flows","Information architecture","Clickable prototype"],"progress_percentage":33,"key_decisions":["Decision based on Vagueness","Resolved through Applied to Wireframing in UI/UX Design context"],"iteration_count":3,"stakeholder_approval":"Approved after iterations"}},{"phase_number":4,"phase_name":"Visual Design","complexity":"High","cognitive_state":"Ambiguity","requirements":["Design high-fidelity chart and KPI mockups","Build reusable dashboard component library","Document color and typography style guide"],"duration_estimate":38,"think_aloud":{"phase_context":"Phase 5: Interaction Design.","cognitive_state":"Tacit","utterance":"Okay, wireframes signed off, data clarity holds up — now high-fidelity. These KPI tiles though. Standardize chart styling, sure, but 'clarity' cuts two ways here. One reading: strip it, one accent, muted grids, let numbers breathe. Other reading: color-code by metric so decision makers scan fast. Both defensible. I'll hedge — neutral tiles, color reserved for deltas only. Lock that into the component library, chart styles, KPI variants. Type scale, palette tokens into the style guide. Mockups landing.","continuity":" Transitioning from Uncertainty in previous phase.","style":"explorer","generation_method":"framework_based","framework_influenced":true},"behaviors":["intuitive_exploration","creative_experimentation","trust_instinct","paradigm_shift_thinking","abductive_leap"],"ai_usage":{"used":true,"tools":[{"tool":"Figma AI","purpose":"Prototype interactions","interaction_type":"Smart animate","satisfaction":4},{"tool":"Midjourney","purpose":"Concept visualization","interaction_type":"Creative generation","satisfaction":4}],"purpose":"Finding reference examples and validating intuitive decisions","effectiveness":0.8110510656406382,"reasoning":"Employing AI to externalize implicit knowledge and validate intuitive design decisions"},"outcomes":{"design_qual