"Wireframe dense data-table layouts","Map cross-dataset drill-down flows","Prototype filter and view-switching paths"],"duration_estimate":35,"think_aloud":{"phase_context":"Phase 4: Data Visualization.","cognitive_state":"Uncertainty","utterance":"Okay, the taxonomy's sorted, card-sort settled the nav. Now — wireframing the dense tables. Twenty years in and I still can't fully articulate why this drill-down feels right and that one doesn't. It's like... this column density reads as calm, the other as noise. Can't hand you a rule. Just — analysts scan left-to-right, so anchor the ID column, let filters live top-rail. There. Blocking the cross-dataset flow, wiring the view-switch into a clickable low-fi. Ships.","continuity":" Transitioning from Vagueness in previous phase.","style":"refiner","generation_method":"framework_based","framework_influenced":true},"behaviors":["safe_choices","proven_patterns","incremental_optimization","constructive_thinking"],"ai_usage":{"used":true,"tools":[{"tool":"Claude","purpose":"Requirement analysis","interaction_type":"Structured analysis","satisfaction":4},{"tool":"Figma AI","purpose":"UI component generation","interaction_type":"Design system automation","satisfaction":4}],"purpose":"Researching data, analyzing trends, and gathering information","effectiveness":0.7113561962593629,"reasoning":"Utilizing AI to gather missing information and explore potential scenarios under uncertainty"},"outcomes":{"design_quality":28.514060068471984,"cognitive_load":11.072680468261407,"satisfaction":5,"quality":4,"innovation":4,"efficiency":2},"actual_duration":50.3,"phase_insights":["Quality concerns identified","High cognitive load - challenging phase"],"framework_approach":"Starts with potential solutions to understand the problem","cognitive_style":"solution_focused","ultra_realistic_think_aloud":"Okay, the taxonomy's sorted, card-sort settled the nav. Now — wireframing the dense tables. Twenty years in and I still can't fully articulate why this drill-down feels right and that one doesn't. It's like... this column density reads as calm, the other as noise. Can't hand you a rule. Just — analysts scan left-to-right, so anchor the ID column, let filters live top-rail. There. Blocking the cross-dataset flow, wiring the view-switch into a clickable low-fi. Ships.","enhanced_requirements":["Develop wireframing based on previous phase for UI/UX Design","Consider unclear requirements for UI/UX Design","Iterate based on feedback for UI/UX Design"],"original_requirements":["Develop wireframing based on previous phase","Consider unclear requirements","Iterate based on feedback"],"cognitive_state_rationale":"Critical information needed for Data Visualization is not yet available","design_context":{"current_challenge":"Making progress despite missing critical information","design_approach":"Starts with potential solutions to understand the problem using solution_focused thinking","key_constraints":["Timeline: 35h allocated","Complexity: High","Dependencies: Technical specs"],"success_criteria":["Stakeholder approval achieved","Design principles maintained","High quality standards met"]},"metadata":{"phase_index":4,"total_phases":6,"domain":"UI/UX Design","project_name":"SaaS Dashboard Redesign","designer":"Designer_72","timestamp":"2024-12-27"},"deliverables":["Low-fidelity wireframes","User flows","Information architecture","Clickable prototype"],"outcome_summary":["High quality output achieved","Innovative solutions developed","Timeline challenges encountered","Stakeholders highly satisfied"],"completion_status":{"status":"Approved","completion_date":"2024-01-18","sign_off":"Ready for next phase"},"cognitive_decision_step":{"action":"Wireframed dense data-table and drill-down layouts into a clickable prototype for operations workflows.","artifact":"Clickable prototype","rationale":{"initial":"Initial approach based on tacit in requirements","improved":"Refined approach after considering budget constraints"}},"ph