ce at the height of the mark's cap, that scales cleanly. Minimum size — pin it so it never muddies. Export the logo: SVG, EPS, PNG, plus mono versions. Package the PDF: logo, type, color, clear-space, do's and don'ts. That covers the real usage. Done.","enhanced_requirements":["Develop production files based on previous phase for Graphic Design","Consider budget constraints for Graphic Design","Iterate based on feedback for Graphic Design"],"original_requirements":["Develop production files based on previous phase","Consider budget constraints","Iterate based on feedback"],"cognitive_state_rationale":"The boundaries and success metrics for Competitive Analysis are fuzzy and subjective","design_context":{"current_challenge":"Transforming fuzzy requirements into concrete design decisions","design_approach":"Creates entirely new frames for understanding problems using transformative thinking","key_constraints":["Timeline: 27h allocated","Complexity: Medium","Dependencies: Design system"],"success_criteria":["Innovative solution delivered","Technical feasibility confirmed","Design principles maintained"]},"metadata":{"phase_index":2,"total_phases":7,"domain":"Graphic Design","project_name":"Brand Identity System","designer":"Designer_77","timestamp":"2024-02-12"},"deliverables":["Research documents","Design iterations","Review feedback","Final deliverables"],"outcome_summary":["Acceptable quality standards met","Innovative solutions developed","Delivered within timeline","Stakeholders highly satisfied"],"completion_status":{"status":"Approved","completion_date":"2024-09-26","sign_off":"Client approved"},"cognitive_decision_step":{"action":"Packaged final Verdant Home logo files and a complete brand guidelines document.","artifact":"Research documents","rationale":{"initial":"Initial approach based on vagueness in requirements","improved":"Refined approach after considering budget constraints"}},"phase_outcome":{"completion_status":"Completed","deliverables_produced":["R