g goes missing on their end. Fonts embedded, links collected. Files feel solid — shipping it.","continuity":" Transitioning from Vagueness in previous phase.","style":"refiner","generation_method":"framework_based","framework_influenced":true},"behaviors":["leverage_experience","iterative_refinement","implicit_adjustment","iterative_reflection_cycles","reflection_in_action"],"ai_usage":{"used":false,"tools":[],"reasoning":"Manual design process for this phase"},"outcomes":{"design_quality":55.10837572299129,"cognitive_load":7.411962177970459,"satisfaction":5,"quality":4,"innovation":4,"efficiency":4},"actual_duration":43.2,"phase_insights":["Quality concerns identified"],"framework_approach":"Continuous dialogue between action and reflection","cognitive_style":"reflective","ultra_realistic_think_aloud":"Refinement's done, consistency holds. Production. Print-ready — I just know when a file's clean, hard to say why. Add 3mm bleed, check the crop marks sit right. Something about the black — convert to rich black, feels right for the poster. Export digital ad sizes: the standard set, leaderboard, MPU, story. Package linked assets and fonts so nothing goes missing on their end. Fonts embedded, links collected. Files feel solid — shipping it.","enhanced_requirements":["Develop production files based on previous phase for Graphic Design","Consider unclear requirements for Graphic Design","Iterate based on feedback for Graphic Design"],"original_requirements":["Develop production files based on previous phase","Consider unclear requirements","Iterate based on feedback"],"cognitive_state_rationale":"The designer's implicit understanding guides decisions that are hard to articulate","design_context":{"current_challenge":"Articulating intuitive design decisions for stakeholder buy-in","design_approach":"Continuous dialogue between action and reflection using reflective thinking","key_constraints":["Timeline: 48h allocated","Complexity: High","Dependencies: Technical specs"],"