inimal. Sketching key visuals. The hero comp — is the product the hero, or is the feeling the hero? Reads both ways off the mood board. I could center the object, or go atmospheric and let the object sit small in space. I'll rough both. Draft the headline over each — top band versus baseline. The atmospheric one's got more air, more studio. Sketch the hero out properly. Compositions down, direction's got a spine now.","continuity":"","style":"explorer","generation_method":"framework_based","framework_influenced":true},"behaviors":["intuitive_exploration","creative_experimentation","trust_instinct","solution_led_exploration"],"ai_usage":{"used":false,"tools":[],"reasoning":"Manual design process for this phase"},"outcomes":{"design_quality":70.51599490297451,"cognitive_load":7.472763411355125,"satisfaction":5,"quality":5,"innovation":5,"efficiency":5},"actual_duration":34.6,"phase_insights":["Sketching completed with ambiguity resolved","Key challenge: unclear requirements"],"framework_approach":"Starts with potential solutions to understand the problem","cognitive_style":"solution_focused","ultra_realistic_think_aloud":"Boards done, tone's warm-minimal. Sketching key visuals. The hero comp — is the product the hero, or is the feeling the hero? Reads both ways off the mood board. I could center the object, or go atmospheric and let the object sit small in space. I'll rough both. Draft the headline over each — top band versus baseline. The atmospheric one's got more air, more studio. Sketch the hero out properly. Compositions down, direction's got a spine now.","enhanced_requirements":["Finalize design documentation for Graphic Design","Ensure quality standards are met for Graphic Design","Prepare handoff documentation for Graphic Design"],"original_requirements":["Finalize design documentation","Ensure quality standards are met","Prepare handoff documentation"],"cognitive_state_rationale":"Pattern recognition from years of Graphic Design experience drives choices in 