e display face to carry the tone — and honestly I just feel which one's right when I set it against the visual. Tried a sharp modern serif, too cold. The humanist one with the slight flare — that's it, warm but crafted, sits into the photography. Can't fully justify it, it just belongs. Test it over the hero, holds at scale. Check the license — commercial's clear. Typeface chosen.","continuity":" Transitioning from Vagueness in previous phase.","style":"explorer","generation_method":"framework_based","framework_influenced":true},"behaviors":["intuitive_exploration","creative_experimentation","trust_instinct","abductive_reasoning_focus"],"ai_usage":{"used":false,"tools":[],"reasoning":"Manual design process for this phase"},"outcomes":{"design_quality":74.6586815926108,"cognitive_load":6.816910493724865,"satisfaction":5,"quality":5,"innovation":3,"efficiency":4},"actual_duration":28.8,"phase_insights":["Typography Selection completed with tacit resolved","Key challenge: tight timeline"],"framework_approach":"Starts with potential solutions to understand the problem","cognitive_style":"solution_focused","ultra_realistic_think_aloud":"Comps sketched, hero's got air. Type now. I need the display face to carry the tone — and honestly I just feel which one's right when I set it against the visual. Tried a sharp modern serif, too cold. The humanist one with the slight flare — that's it, warm but crafted, sits into the photography. Can't fully justify it, it just belongs. Test it over the hero, holds at scale. Check the license — commercial's clear. Typeface chosen.","enhanced_requirements":["Develop typography selection based on previous phase for Graphic Design","Consider tight timeline for Graphic Design","Iterate based on feedback for Graphic Design"],"original_requirements":["Develop typography selection based on previous phase","Consider tight timeline","Iterate based on feedback"],"cognitive_state_rationale":"The designer's implicit understanding guides decisions tha