ny touchpoints? Reads both ways. I'll take it as broad reach across many surfaces, that drives a system, not one hero. Only eight years in but I've learned to find the one idea that travels. Map the touchpoints — OOH, web, social, print. Explore concepts around a single unifying thread. Concepts down, idea forming.","continuity":"","style":"converger","generation_method":"framework_based","framework_influenced":true},"behaviors":["set_specific_criteria","request_concrete_values","systematic_specification","conversation_with_materials","iterative_reflection_cycles"],"ai_usage":{"used":true,"tools":[{"tool":"Claude","purpose":"Design documentation","interaction_type":"Technical writing","satisfaction":4},{"tool":"Midjourney","purpose":"Design inspiration","interaction_type":"Open exploration","satisfaction":5}],"purpose":"Concretizing vague requirements and finding specific examples","effectiveness":0.6458974501041613,"reasoning":"Leveraging AI to clarify fuzzy requirements and generate concrete examples from vague descriptions"},"outcomes":{"design_quality":55.001140105530155,"cognitive_load":5.917260578761833,"satisfaction":5,"quality":4,"innovation":5,"efficiency":2},"actual_duration":21.4,"phase_insights":["Quality concerns identified"],"framework_approach":"Continuous dialogue between action and reflection","cognitive_style":"reflective","ultra_realistic_think_aloud":"New brief, Ridgeway Outdoors, large-scale, print and digital. First phase, concept. \"Large-scale\" — does that mean big physical formats, billboards, or large in reach, many touchpoints? Reads both ways. I'll take it as broad reach across many surfaces, that drives a system, not one hero. Only eight years in but I've learned to find the one idea that travels. Map the touchpoints — OOH, web, social, print. Explore concepts around a single unifying thread. Concepts down, idea forming.","enhanced_requirements":["Understand innovative design solution for Graphic Design","Address budget constraints for 