e thing I need before handoff: whether Bastienne Paris's factory can hold the washed-linen finish at bulk, or if the hand shifts at scale — haven't got that confirmation back yet. So I finalize the samples, but flag the finish spec on the line sheet for production to verify. Compile the lookbook, build the line sheet. Hand off to Bastienne Paris.","continuity":" Transitioning from Tacit in previous phase.","style":"refiner","generation_method":"framework_based","framework_influenced":true},"behaviors":["gradual_refinement","incremental_adjustments","feedback_driven","constraint_as_creativity","problem_reframing"],"ai_usage":{"used":true,"tools":[{"tool":"Stable Diffusion","purpose":"Texture generation","interaction_type":"Pattern creation","satisfaction":3},{"tool":"GitHub Copilot","purpose":"Design system coding","interaction_type":"Component generation","satisfaction":4}],"purpose":"Concretizing vague requirements and finding specific examples","effectiveness":0.6865412918308557,"reasoning":"Leveraging AI to clarify fuzzy requirements and generate concrete examples from vague descriptions"},"outcomes":{"design_quality":89.1363467588261,"cognitive_load":5.876871934090587,"satisfaction":5,"quality":4,"innovation":4,"efficiency":2},"actual_duration":16.3,"phase_insights":["High-quality output achieved","Quality improvement from previous phase"],"framework_approach":"Redefines problems, uses constraints creatively","cognitive_style":"negotiative","ultra_realistic_think_aloud":"Fits marked and approved — final push, production-ready samples and lookbook. One thing I need before handoff: whether Bastienne Paris's factory can hold the washed-linen finish at bulk, or if the hand shifts at scale — haven't got that confirmation back yet. So I finalize the samples, but flag the finish spec on the line sheet for production to verify. Compile the lookbook, build the line sheet. Hand off to Bastienne Paris.","enhanced_requirements":["Develop final collection based on previous p