al deliverables"],"progress_percentage":57,"key_decisions":["Decision based on Tacit","Resolved through Applied to Trend Research in Fashion Design context"],"iteration_count":2,"stakeholder_approval":"Approved after iterations"}},{"phase_number":2,"phase_name":"Concept Development","complexity":"Medium","cognitive_state":"Uncertainty","requirements":["Lock a single tight concept","Set focused color story","Draft concise concept statement"],"duration_estimate":31,"think_aloud":{"phase_context":"Phase 7: Fitting & Refinement.","cognitive_state":"Tacit","utterance":"Three directions shortlisted — now lock one. Here's what I don't have: the studio's launch date. Six weeks or nine changes everything. Nine, I could push the techy-drape. Six, I can't. I'll assume the tighter window and flag it in the deck. So — washed pastels, single concept, day-into-evening ease. Color story: three washed tones, one clean white, one deep anchor. Concept statement, two sentences, no more. Mood board's tight. Done, moving to fabric.","continuity":" Transitioning from Uncertainty in previous phase.","style":"explorer","generation_method":"framework_based","framework_influenced":true},"behaviors":["intuitive_exploration","creative_experimentation","trust_instinct","iterative_reflection_cycles","conversation_with_materials"],"ai_usage":{"used":false,"tools":[],"reasoning":"Manual design process for this phase"},"outcomes":{"design_quality":57.69198097211756,"cognitive_load":5.2737757305557915,"satisfaction":5,"quality":4,"innovation":4,"efficiency":4},"actual_duration":27.9,"phase_insights":["Quality concerns identified","Quality improvement from previous phase"],"framework_approach":"Continuous dialogue between action and reflection","cognitive_style":"reflective","ultra_realistic_think_aloud":"Three directions shortlisted — now lock one. Here's what I don't have: the studio's launch date. Six weeks or nine changes everything. Nine, I could push the techy-drape. Six, I can't. I'll assume the tighter window and flag it in the deck. So — washed pastels, single concept, day-into-evening ease. Color story: three washed tones, one clean white, one deep anchor. Concept statement, two sentences, no more. Mood board's tight. Done, moving to fabric.","enhanced_requirements":["Finalize final assets for Fashion Design","Ensure quality standards are met for Fashion Design","Prepare handoff documentation for Fashion Design"],"original_requirements":["Finalize final assets","Ensure quality standards are met","Prepare handoff documentation"],"cognitive_state_rationale":"Success in Fitting & Refinement relies heavily on experiential knowledge and intuition","design_context":{"current_challenge":"Articulating intuitive design decisions for stakeholder buy-in","design_approach":"Continuous dialogue between action and reflection using reflective thinking","key_constraints":["Timeline: 31h allocated","Complexity: Medium","Dependencies: Design system"],"success_criteria":["Technical feasibility confirmed","High quality standards met","User testing validation"]},"metadata":{"phase_index":7,"total_phases":8,"domain":"Fashion Design","project_name":"Spring/Summer Collection","designer":"Designer_84","timestamp":"2024-04-20"},"deliverables":["Mood boards","Trend research","Color story","Concept statement"],"outcome_summary":["High quality output achieved","Innovative solutions developed","Completed ahead of schedule","Stakeholders highly satisfied"],"completion_status":{"status":"In Review","completion_date":"2024-04-15","sign_off":"Client approved"},"cognitive_decision_step":{"action":"Locked one focused concept and color story to fit Kite & Cloth's fast-tracked schedule.","artifact":"Concept statement","rationale":{"initial":"Initial approach based on uncertainty in requirements","improved":"Refined approach after considering unclear requirements"}},"phase_outcome":{"completion_status":"Completed","deliverables_produced":["Mood boards","Trend research","Color story","Concept statement"],"progress_percentage":100,"key_decisions":["Decision based on Uncertainty","Resolved through Applied to Concept Development in Fashion Design context"],"iteration_count":3,"stakeholder_approval":"Approved"}},{"phase_number":3,"phase_name":"Fabric Selection","complexity":"Medium","cognitive_state":"Uncertainty","requirements":["Select ready-stock fabrics","Verify immediate availability","Test basic drape quickly"],"duration_estimate":33,"think_aloud":{"phase_context":"Phase 3: Sketching & Ideation.","cognitive_state":"Vagueness","utterance":"Concept locked, pastels — now fabric, and this is where the timeline bites. What I don't know yet: actual roll quantities in the warehouse. A swatch being in-stock doesn't mean forty meters is. I'll pull the stock report before I fully commit. For now — that washed cotton poplin, the viscose-jersey blend, a light linen-look. All ready-stock, warm-weather. Quick drape test on the jersey... yes, falls right. Availability I verify tomorrow. Fabrics selected, flagged pending the roll counts.","continuity":" Transitioning from Tacit in previous phase.","style":"explorer","generation_method":"framework_based","framework_influenced":true},"behaviors":["create_multiple_variations","visual_experimentation","broad_exploration","reflection_in_action"],"ai_usage":{"used":true,"tools":[{"tool":"Stable Diffusion","purpose":"Style transfer","interaction_type":"Image-to-image","satisfaction":4},{"tool":"GitHub Copilot","purpose":"Code implementation","interaction_type":"Code completion","satisfaction":5}],"purpose":"Concretizing vague requirements and finding specific examples","effectiveness":0.8784145771868657,"reasoning":"Leveraging AI to clarify fuzzy requirements and generate concrete examples from vague descriptions"},"outcomes":{"design_quality":63.48677999151205,"cognitive_load":5.5585346827909365,"satisfaction":5,"quality":4,"innovation":5,"efficiency":3},"actual_duration":33.7,"phase_insights":["Fabric Selection completed with uncertainty resolved","Key challenge: tight timeline"],"framework_approach":"Continuous dialogue between action and reflection","cognitive_style":"reflective","ultra_realistic_think_aloud":"Concept locked, pastels — now fabric, and this is where the timeline bites. What I don't know yet: actual roll quantities in the warehouse. A swatch being in-stock doesn't mean forty meters is. I'll pull the stock report before I fully commit. For now — that washed cotton poplin, the viscose-jersey blend, a light linen-look. All ready-stock, warm-weather. Quick drape test on the jersey... yes, falls right. Availability I verify tomorrow. Fabrics selected, flagged pending the roll counts.","enhanced_requirements":["Develop fabric selection based on previous phase for Fashion Design","Consider unclear requirements for Fashion Design","Iterate based on feedback for Fashion Design"],"original_requirements":["Develop fabric selection based on previous phase","Consider unclear requirements","Iterate based on feedback"],"cognitive_state_rationale":"Key terms in Sketching & Ideation lack precise definitions or measurable criteria","design_context":{"current_challenge":"Transforming fuzzy requirements into concrete design decisions","design_approach":"Continuous dialogue between action and reflection using reflective thinking","key_constraints":["Timeline: 33h allocated","Complexity: Medium","Dependencies: Stakeholder approval"],"success_criteria":["High quality standards met","Technical feasibility confirmed","Innovative solution delivered"]},"metadata":{"phase_index":3,"total_phases":8,"domain":"Fashion Design","project_name":"Spring/Summer Collection","designer":"Designer_84","timestamp":"2024-11-05"},"deliverables":["Research documents","Design iterations","Review feedback","Final deliverables"],"outcome_summary":["High quality output achieved","Innovative solutions developed","Delivered within timeline","Stakeholders highly satisfied"],"completion_status":{"status":"In Review","completion_date":"2024-11-21","sign_off":"Client approved"},"cognitive_decision_step":{"action":"Selected in-stock warm-weather fabrics with immediate availability for the fast-tracked SS line.","artifact":"Design iterations","rationale":{"initial":"Initial approach based on uncertainty in requirements","improved":"Refined approach after considering budget constraints"}},"phase_outcome":{"completion_status":"Completed","deliverables_produced":["Research documents","Design iterations","Review feedback","Final deliverables"],"progress_percentage":43,"key_decisions":["Decision based on Uncertainty","Resolved through Applied to Fabric Selection in Fashion Design context"],"iteration_count":3,"stakeholder_approval":"Approved after iterations"}},{"phase_number":4,"phase_name":"Sketching","complexity":"Low","cognitive_state":"Vagueness","requirements":["Sketch core looks fast","Draw essential technical flats","Assign limited colorways"],"duration_estimate":11,"think_aloud":{"phase_context":"Phase 2: Mood Board Creation.","cognitive_state":"Tacit","utterance":"Fabrics in, three ready-stock — now sketch the core looks. \"Tight colorway range\" — but how tight? Three per style? Two? It's a dial. Too few reads thin for a launch, too many blows the sample budget on this timeline. I'll set it at two colorways per look, three on the hero pieces. Sketching fast now — six core looks, essential flats for each, seam lines only. Assigning the washed tones across them. Flats done, colorways mapped. Good enough to cut.","continuity":" Transitioning from Uncertainty in previous phase.","style":"explorer","generation_method":"framework_based","framework_influenced":true},"behaviors":["intuitive_exploration","creative_experimentation","trust_instinct","iterative_reflection_cycles","conversation_with_materials"],"ai_usage":{"used":true,"tools":[{"tool":"Stable Diffusion","purpose":"Design iteration","interaction_type":"ControlNet guidance","satisfaction":5},{"tool":"ChatGPT","purpose":"Und