ent fixes entirely. I'll sew it with a touch more room first — easier to pin out than let out. First pass on all six, capturing notes as I go. Production samples prepped. Sample stage compressed, done.","continuity":"","style":"explorer","generation_method":"framework_based","framework_influenced":true},"behaviors":["prepare_multiple_scenarios","hypothesis_testing","parallel_prototyping","reflection_in_action"],"ai_usage":{"used":true,"tools":[{"tool":"Figma AI","purpose":"Layout suggestions","interaction_type":"Auto-layout","satisfaction":3},{"tool":"Stable Diffusion","purpose":"Rapid prototyping visuals","interaction_type":"Local generation","satisfaction":4}],"purpose":"Researching data, analyzing trends, and gathering information","effectiveness":0.7623237545296537,"reasoning":"Utilizing AI to gather missing information and explore potential scenarios under uncertainty"},"outcomes":{"design_quality":54.22752234506933,"cognitive_load":6.798557965960149,"satisfaction":5,"quality":3,"innovation":3,"efficiency":3},"actual_duration":32,"phase_insights":["Quality concerns identified"],"framework_approach":"Continuous dialogue between action and reflection","cognitive_style":"reflective","ultra_realistic_think_aloud":"Patterns adapted — now sew first samples, toile and sample in one pass to save time. This fit note from the pattern stage: \"ease at waist.\" Ease could mean add room, or it could mean smooth the seam line so it sits cleaner. Different fixes entirely. I'll sew it with a touch more room first — easier to pin out than let out. First pass on all six, capturing notes as I go. Production samples prepped. Sample stage compressed, done.","enhanced_requirements":["Understand innovative design solution for Fashion Design","Address budget constraints for Fashion Design","Define project scope and constraints for Fashion Design"],"original_requirements":["Understand innovative design solution","Address budget constraints","Define project scope and constraints"],"cogn