w one consolidated fit session to close it out. \"Final adjustments\" — how final is final? On this timeline there's a line where good-enough ships and I stop chasing perfect. The shift hangs clean, the jersey top needs a half-inch off the hem, call it there. Marking adjustments on the spot, no second round. Fourteen years tells me these are ready. Samples approved, graded patterns signed off. Collection's delivered.","continuity":" Transitioning from Tacit in previous phase.","style":"explorer","generation_method":"framework_based","framework_influenced":true},"behaviors":["prepare_multiple_scenarios","hypothesis_testing","parallel_prototyping","conversation_with_materials","reflection_in_action"],"ai_usage":{"used":true,"tools":[{"tool":"Figma AI","purpose":"Design consistency checking","interaction_type":"Rule-based analysis","satisfaction":5},{"tool":"Stable Diffusion","purpose":"Design iteration","interaction_type":"ControlNet guidance","satisfaction":5}],"purpose":"Researching data, analyzing trends, and gathering information","effectiveness":0.6730788771984839,"reasoning":"Utilizing AI to gather missing information and explore potential scenarios under uncertainty"},"outcomes":{"design_quality":48.18927504808783,"cognitive_load":10.299938551854543,"satisfaction":5,"quality":3,"innovation":4,"efficiency":2},"actual_duration":38.7,"phase_insights":["Quality concerns identified","High cognitive load - challenging phase"],"framework_approach":"Continuous dialogue between action and reflection","cognitive_style":"reflective","ultra_realistic_think_aloud":"Samples sewn in one pass — now one consolidated fit session to close it out. \"Final adjustments\" — how final is final? On this timeline there's a line where good-enough ships and I stop chasing perfect. The shift hangs clean, the jersey top needs a half-inch off the hem, call it there. Marking adjustments on the spot, no second round. Fourteen years tells me these are ready. Samples approved, graded patterns si