ormula. The tote gusset nested against the strap pieces — I just move them around the marker until the offcuts look wrong or right, and I can't hand you the rule, my eye knows when a layout's wasting cork. There, that nesting's tight. Belt pieces slot into the gaps. Pattern pieces drafted, zero-waste markers planned, material tech pack compiled. Good.","continuity":"","style":"converger","generation_method":"framework_based","framework_influenced":true},"behaviors":["request_clarification","bracket_interpretations","systematic_analysis","bounded_rationality_acceptance","problem_decomposition"],"ai_usage":{"used":true,"tools":[{"tool":"GitHub Copilot","purpose":"Design system coding","interaction_type":"Component generation","satisfaction":4},{"tool":"Figma AI","purpose":"Layout suggestions","interaction_type":"Auto-layout","satisfaction":3}],"purpose":"Exploring multiple interpretations and generating diverse options","effectiveness":0.9423107758963138,"reasoning":"Using AI to explore multiple interpretations and generate diverse solutions for ambiguous requirements"},"outcomes":{"design_quality":33.23684467059886,"cognitive_load":9.537458231751875,"satisfaction":5,"quality":5,"innovation":4,"efficiency":4},"actual_duration":54.1,"phase_insights":["Pattern Making completed with tacit resolved","Key challenge: tight timeline"],"framework_approach":"Applied to Pattern Making in Fashion Design context","cognitive_style":"analytical_pragmatic","ultra_realistic_think_aloud":"Concepts illustrated — now draft patterns and lay out zero-waste markers. This is feel more than formula. The tote gusset nested against the strap pieces — I just move them around the marker until the offcuts look wrong or right, and I can't hand you the rule, my eye knows when a layout's wasting cork. There, that nesting's tight. Belt pieces slot into the gaps. Pattern pieces drafted, zero-waste markers planned, material tech pack compiled. Good.","enhanced_requirements":["Finalize final assets for 