ation","interaction_type":"Comment completion","satisfaction":3}],"purpose":"Finding reference examples and validating intuitive decisions","effectiveness":0.695115540209463,"reasoning":"Employing AI to externalize implicit knowledge and validate intuitive design decisions"},"outcomes":{"design_quality":39.32366816129595,"cognitive_load":4.353441065181643,"satisfaction":5,"quality":5,"innovation":4,"efficiency":4},"actual_duration":20.9,"phase_insights":["Quality concerns identified"],"framework_approach":"Breaks problems down, seeks good-enough solutions","cognitive_style":"analytical_pragmatic","ultra_realistic_think_aloud":"Fit's finalized — now assemble and shoot the finished line for Juno Made. One thing I still need to nail: the exact recycled content percentage on the leather for the provenance sheet. \"Recycled\" isn't a number, and they'll want the number. I'll pull the mill's spec, not estimate it. Meanwhile the range comes together on the table — bags, belts, clean and cohesive. Photographing on the neutral set. Sourcing docs compiled, percentage pending the mill sheet. Collection's delivered.","enhanced_requirements":["Develop final collection based on previous phase for Fashion Design","Consider budget constraints for Fashion Design","Iterate based on feedback for Fashion Design"],"original_requirements":["Develop final collection based on previous phase","Consider budget constraints","Iterate based on feedback"],"cognitive_state_rationale":"Success in Prototyping relies heavily on experiential knowledge and intuition","design_context":{"current_challenge":"Articulating intuitive design decisions for stakeholder buy-in","design_approach":"Breaks problems down, seeks good-enough solutions using analytical_pragmatic thinking","key_constraints":["Timeline: 21h allocated","Complexity: Medium","Dependencies: Design system"],"success_criteria":["Technical feasibility confirmed","Stakeholder approval achieved","Innovative solution delivered"]},"metadata":{"pha