bric swatches pinned, silhouette directions mapped toward that soft-collapse line. Boards compiled.","continuity":" Transitioning from Ambiguity in previous phase.","style":"explorer","generation_method":"framework_based","framework_influenced":true},"behaviors":["intuitive_exploration","creative_experimentation","trust_instinct","frame_creation","abductive_leap"],"ai_usage":{"used":false,"tools":[],"reasoning":"Manual design process for this phase"},"outcomes":{"design_quality":82.97152063186361,"cognitive_load":4.412597909853019,"satisfaction":5,"quality":5,"innovation":5,"efficiency":4},"actual_duration":20.2,"phase_insights":["High-quality output achieved","Quality improvement from previous phase"],"framework_approach":"Creates entirely new frames for understanding problems","cognitive_style":"transformative","ultra_realistic_think_aloud":"Right — Nym Couture, concept SS showcase. Experimental silhouettes, experimental fabrics, forward-looking. Scanning the runways and street now. This coated technical drape... yes. That stiff bonded jersey — no, too costume, doesn't breathe the season. Can't fully justify it, it just doesn't sit in the same room as the fluid stuff. Pulling references: liquid tailoring, deflated volumes, translucency. Building the trend boards, fabric swatches pinned, silhouette directions mapped toward that soft-collapse line. Boards compiled.","enhanced_requirements":["Develop trend research based on previous phase for Fashion Design","Consider budget constraints for Fashion Design","Iterate based on feedback for Fashion Design"],"original_requirements":["Develop trend research based on previous phase","Consider budget constraints","Iterate based on feedback"],"cognitive_state_rationale":"Success in Fabric Selection relies heavily on experiential knowledge and intuition","design_context":{"current_challenge":"Articulating intuitive design decisions for stakeholder buy-in","design_approach":"Creates entirely new frames for understanding problem