r go grey. I'll build the palette to hold under both — bleaning water-clear neutrals with one acid note — and flag the lighting question for the showcase team. Concept statement: matter in mid-collapse. Mood boards assembled, fabric direction drafted toward the sheer technicals. Concept locked.","continuity":" Transitioning from Tacit in previous phase.","style":"explorer","generation_method":"framework_based","framework_influenced":true},"behaviors":["explore_multiple_interpretations","create_divergent_options","delay_decisions","frame_creation"],"ai_usage":{"used":true,"tools":[{"tool":"Figma AI","purpose":"Layout suggestions","interaction_type":"Auto-layout","satisfaction":3},{"tool":"Midjourney","purpose":"Concept visualization","interaction_type":"Creative generation","satisfaction":4}],"purpose":"Exploring multiple interpretations and generating diverse options","effectiveness":0.8001516073925575,"reasoning":"Using AI to explore multiple interpretations and generate diverse solutions for ambiguous requirements"},"outcomes":{"design_quality":72.58961527023675,"cognitive_load":6.7384063215080365,"satisfaction":5,"quality":4,"innovation":4,"efficiency":3},"actual_duration":32.4,"phase_insights":["Concept Development completed with uncertainty resolved","Key challenge: unclear requirements"],"framework_approach":"Creates entirely new frames for understanding problems","cognitive_style":"transformative","ultra_realistic_think_aloud":"Trend boards are up, fluid direction's set — now concept. Building the color story and I don't have the venue lighting from Nym Couture. Warm tungsten or cold gallery LED completely changes whether these translucents glow or go grey. I'll build the palette to hold under both — bleaning water-clear neutrals with one acid note — and flag the lighting question for the showcase team. Concept statement: matter in mid-collapse. Mood boards assembled, fabric direction drafted toward the sheer technicals. Concept locked.","enhanced_requirement