up's budget. Design the cards and letterhead, lay out the deck template, prep the email signature. Collateral produced, template set built.","enhanced_requirements":["Develop collateral development based on previous phase for Brand Design","Consider unclear requirements for Brand Design","Iterate based on feedback for Brand Design"],"original_requirements":["Develop collateral development based on previous phase","Consider unclear requirements","Iterate based on feedback"],"cognitive_state_rationale":"Pattern recognition from years of Brand Design experience drives choices in Brand Guidelines","design_context":{"current_challenge":"Articulating intuitive design decisions for stakeholder buy-in","design_approach":"Redefines problems, uses constraints creatively using negotiative thinking","key_constraints":["Timeline: 20h allocated","Complexity: Medium","Dependencies: Design system"],"success_criteria":["Technical feasibility confirmed","Innovative solution delivered","Design principles maintained"]},"metadata":{"phase_index":6,"total_phases":7,"domain":"Brand Design","project_name":"Startup Brand Development","designer":"Designer_96","timestamp":"2024-10-05"},"deliverables":["Research documents","Design iterations","Review feedback","Final deliverables"],"outcome_summary":["High quality output achieved","Innovative solutions developed","Completed ahead of schedule","Stakeholders highly satisfied"],"completion_status":{"status":"In Review","completion_date":"2024-12-22","sign_off":"Internal review complete"},"cognitive_decision_step":{"action":"Produced Kelp Health stationery and branded presentation template collateral.","artifact":"Review feedback","rationale":{"initial":"Initial approach based on vagueness in requirements","improved":"Refined approach after considering unclear requirements"}},"phase_outcome":{"completion_status":"Completed","deliverables_produced":["Research documents","Design iterations","Review feedback","Final deliverables"],"progress_percentag