nobody notices; redraw it and we've thrown away the equity we're protecting. It's a matter of degree. I'll keep the silhouette, clean the curves, tighten spacing — evolution not revolution. Test a few wordmark variations against the old one side by side. If it still reads as them at a glance, it's right. Refined mark's landing.","continuity":" Transitioning from Uncertainty in previous phase.","style":"explorer","generation_method":"framework_based","framework_influenced":true},"behaviors":["create_multiple_variations","visual_experimentation","broad_exploration","problem_decomposition"],"ai_usage":{"used":true,"tools":[{"tool":"Claude","purpose":"Design documentation","interaction_type":"Technical writing","satisfaction":4},{"tool":"GitHub Copilot","purpose":"Interaction logic","interaction_type":"Function suggestions","satisfaction":4}],"purpose":"Concretizing vague requirements and finding specific examples","effectiveness":0.8553374165856273,"reasoning":"Leveraging AI to clarify fuzzy requirements and generate concrete examples from vague descriptions"},"outcomes":{"design_quality":51.21211214509841,"cognitive_load":8.84851041040613,"satisfaction":5,"quality":3,"innovation":4,"efficiency":3},"actual_duration":41.8,"phase_insights":["Quality concerns identified","High cognitive load - challenging phase"],"framework_approach":"Breaks problems down, seeks good-enough solutions","cognitive_style":"analytical_pragmatic","ultra_realistic_think_aloud":"Strategy realigned, scope agreed — logo now. This is the tightrope: modernize but keep it recognizable. How much change is too much? Nudge the letterforms and nobody notices; redraw it and we've thrown away the equity we're protecting. It's a matter of degree. I'll keep the silhouette, clean the curves, tighten spacing — evolution not revolution. Test a few wordmark variations against the old one side by side. If it still reads as them at a glance, it's right. Refined mark's landing.","enhanced_requirements":["Develop lo