ration_estimate":23,"think_aloud":{"phase_context":"Phase 6: Brand Guidelines.","cognitive_state":"Tacit","utterance":"Right, research done, competitor gap mapped. Now positioning. \"Lean\" — how lean, though? Is that one page, or a tight deck? It's a dial. Trim too hard and the voice pillars vanish; keep too much and the small team never reads it. I set it mid — a one-line positioning statement, three messaging pillars, a short list. Prioritize the cheap touchpoints: email sig, cards, a landing hero. That's the draft.","continuity":"","style":"explorer","generation_method":"framework_based","framework_influenced":true},"behaviors":["intuitive_exploration","creative_experimentation","trust_instinct","bounded_rationality_acceptance","problem_decomposition"],"ai_usage":{"used":true,"tools":[{"tool":"Figma AI","purpose":"Design consistency checking","interaction_type":"Rule-based analysis","satisfaction":5},{"tool":"Midjourney","purpose":"Aesthetic exploration","interaction_type":"Style prompting","satisfaction":5}],"purpose":"Finding reference examples and validating intuitive decisions","effectiveness":0.9367292502850975,"reasoning":"Employing AI to externalize implicit knowledge and validate intuitive design decisions"},"outcomes":{"design_quality":67.03107909994868,"cognitive_load":4.5535870411379245,"satisfaction":5,"quality":4,"innovation":5,"efficiency":4},"actual_duration":17.6,"phase_insights":["Strategy Development completed with vagueness resolved","Key challenge: tight timeline"],"framework_approach":"Breaks problems down, seeks good-enough solutions","cognitive_style":"analytical_pragmatic","ultra_realistic_think_aloud":"Right, research done, competitor gap mapped. Now positioning. \"Lean\" — how lean, though? Is that one page, or a tight deck? It's a dial. Trim too hard and the voice pillars vanish; keep too much and the small team never reads it. I set it mid — a one-line positioning statement, three messaging pillars, a short list. Prioritize the cheap 