kely, note the rest. Landing hero laid out, monogram top-left, headline pulling the positioning line. Profile avatars and banners at each spec. Ad and post templates on the grid. Done.","continuity":" Transitioning from Vagueness in previous phase.","style":"explorer","generation_method":"framework_based","framework_influenced":true},"behaviors":["intuitive_exploration","creative_experimentation","trust_instinct","bounded_rationality_acceptance"],"ai_usage":{"used":true,"tools":[{"tool":"GitHub Copilot","purpose":"Code implementation","interaction_type":"Code completion","satisfaction":5},{"tool":"Claude","purpose":"Design documentation","interaction_type":"Technical writing","satisfaction":4}],"purpose":"Finding reference examples and validating intuitive decisions","effectiveness":0.6206991630851539,"reasoning":"Employing AI to externalize implicit knowledge and validate intuitive design decisions"},"outcomes":{"design_quality":63.77657048250875,"cognitive_load":4.54733546608068,"satisfaction":5,"quality":5,"innovation":3,"efficiency":5},"actual_duration":19.1,"phase_insights":["Quality improvement from previous phase"],"framework_approach":"Breaks problems down, seeks good-enough solutions","cognitive_style":"analytical_pragmatic","ultra_realistic_think_aloud":"Cards and letterhead done. Now launch applications. \"Social profile kit\" — LinkedIn and X sizing, or the full Instagram-plus set too? Depends where a B2B venture actually lives. I'll assume LinkedIn, X, and one Instagram as insurance — cover the likely, note the rest. Landing hero laid out, monogram top-left, headline pulling the positioning line. Profile avatars and banners at each spec. Ad and post templates on the grid. Done.","enhanced_requirements":["Develop application design based on previous phase for Brand Design","Consider budget constraints for Brand Design","Iterate based on feedback for Brand Design"],"original_requirements":["Develop application design based on previous phase","Consider bud